{
    "title": "Tandem: Language exchange",
    "description": "<b>Learning a language is made easier when it\u2019s fun.</b>\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re aiming to learn a new language or improve fluency in one you already know, having engaging conversations with an exchange partner makes all the difference. You can even learn a language with international friends while expanding your skills and cultural understanding.\r\n\r\nWhatever your language goal is\u2014language learning for travel, business, or personal growth\u2014you can reach it while meeting new people and making friends around the globe.It\u2019s easy: just choose a language you want to learn, find a Tandem member with similar interests, and you\u2019re ready to go! From language transfer to cultural insights, the possibilities are endless.\r\n\r\nOnce you\u2019re connected, the real fun begins! Learn from each other, practice speaking, and find fluency faster through conversation practice! Text, call, or even video chat\u2014communication with your language exchange partner is as flexible as you need it to be. It\u2019s the perfect way to meet people and improve your language skills at the same time. It\u2019s time to make progress on your learning journey together!\r\n\r\nWith Tandem, you can learn languages through 1-to-1 chats or try out Parties, the ultimate group learning audio space. There are millions of Tandem members with just as many interests, so find your people and start speaking their language today!\r\n\r\nChoose from over 300 languages:\r\n- Spanish \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfd\r\n- English \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\r\n- Japanese \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5\r\n- Korean \ud83c\uddf0\ud83c\uddf7\r\n- German \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea,\r\n- Italian \ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf9\r\n- Portuguese \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7\r\n- Russian \ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa\r\n- Simplified and Traditional Chinese \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\uddfc\r\n- 12 different sign languages, including American Sign Language.\r\n\r\n<b>DOWNLOAD TANDEM AND LEARN A LANGUAGE NOW!</b>\r\nTandem unites people across borders through language learning. The best way to thrive in our interconnected world is to learn a new language AND understand the people and culture behind it! Whether you\u2019re looking to make international friends, talk to strangers, or connect with others who are passionate about languages, Tandem has it all.\r\n\r\n<b>BETTER VOCAB</b>\r\nSkip the tricky grammar tests and random phrases. Tandem allows you to focus on meaningful conversation practice, centered around topics you care about.\r\n\r\n<b>PERFECT PRONUNCIATION</b>\r\nWant to sound like a native speaker? One way to help is to practice a language with your exchange partner until you\u2019ve mastered every word and phrase.\r\n\r\n<b>SOUND LIKE A LOCAL</b>\r\nPractice a language with voice notes, audio, and video chats until you sound like a native speaker. Whether you\u2019re looking for tips on pronunciation or want to speak more casually in your fluency, this is the language exchange app for you.\r\n\r\n<b>MAKE INTERNATIONAL FRIENDS</b>\r\nTandem connects you with international friends who share your passion for language learning. By engaging in conversations with people from different parts of the world, you\u2019ll not only practice speaking, but also gain insights into various cultures. \r\n\r\n<b>IMMERSIVE GROUP LEARNING</b>\r\nExperience group learning like never before with Tandem\u2019s interactive Parties! Whether you want to practice a language by listening in on group conversations or take the lead and start your own language Party, you\u2019ll benefit from the dynamic, immersive environment.\r\n\r\n<b>GRAMMAR TIPS & TRICKS</b>\r\nUse translation features and text corrections to master grammar from the first try. From perfecting everyday speed to formal language transfer, you\u2019ll always have support.\r\n\r\nHow to learn languages on Tandem:\r\n\r\n1. Build a profile\r\n2. Share your goals and interests\r\n3. Find the right exchange partners\r\n4. Break the ice via text, audio, or video calls\r\n5. Join a group Language Party and listen in \u2013 or lead a Party of your own!\r\n\r\nGot a question? Contact us on support@tandem.net or chat with us on our social channels...\r\n\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/TandemAppHQ\r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@TandemAppHQ",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Learning a language is made easier when it\u2019s fun.</b><br><br>Whether you\u2019re aiming to learn a new language or improve fluency in one you already know, having engaging conversations with an exchange partner makes all the difference. You can even learn a language with international friends while expanding your skills and cultural understanding.<br><br>Whatever your language goal is\u2014language learning for travel, business, or personal growth\u2014you can reach it while meeting new people and making friends around the globe.It\u2019s easy: just choose a language you want to learn, find a Tandem member with similar interests, and you\u2019re ready to go! From language transfer to cultural insights, the possibilities are endless.<br><br>Once you\u2019re connected, the real fun begins! Learn from each other, practice speaking, and find fluency faster through conversation practice! Text, call, or even video chat\u2014communication with your language exchange partner is as flexible as you need it to be. It\u2019s the perfect way to meet people and improve your language skills at the same time. It\u2019s time to make progress on your learning journey together!<br><br>With Tandem, you can learn languages through 1-to-1 chats or try out Parties, the ultimate group learning audio space. There are millions of Tandem members with just as many interests, so find your people and start speaking their language today!<br><br>Choose from over 300 languages:<br>- Spanish \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfd<br>- English \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8<br>- Japanese \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5<br>- Korean \ud83c\uddf0\ud83c\uddf7<br>- German \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea,<br>- Italian \ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf9<br>- Portuguese \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7<br>- Russian \ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa<br>- Simplified and Traditional Chinese \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\uddfc<br>- 12 different sign languag