rofile<br>2. Share your goals and interests<br>3. Find the right exchange partners<br>4. Break the ice via text, audio, or video calls<br>5. Join a group Language Party and listen in \u2013 or lead a Party of your own!<br><br>Got a question? Contact us on support@tandem.net or chat with us on our social channels...<br><br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/TandemAppHQ<br>TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@TandemAppHQ",
